{"id":"n27821-1-7","stage":1,"title":"축구공 · 足球","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n27821-1-7-1","ko":"민준아, 이마가 왜 그래? 다쳤어?","zh":"敏俊，你的额头怎么了？受伤了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준아,","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；아：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"민준아","audio":"/audio/8016ce64193f3153a82a.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준아","audio":"/audio/8016ce64193f3153a82a.mp3"}},{"text":"이마가","meaning":"额，前额，额头","explanation":"이마：额，前额，额头；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이마","audio":"/audio/772813c770d7cbf82ae4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71693","senseId":"1","lemma":"이마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이마가","audio":"/audio/a62325e67164eceef8ce.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"그래?","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}},{"text":"다쳤어?","meaning":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","explanation":"다치다：受伤，负伤，弄伤；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"다치다","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73400","senseId":"1","lemma":"다치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다쳤어","audio":"/audio/86ade1e1d41a865d3f79.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"772813c770d7cbf8","term":"이마","zh":"额，前额，额头","audio":"/audio/772813c770d7cbf82ae4.mp3","entryId":"71693","definition":"指人脸眉毛以上、头发以下的部分。","pronunciation":["이마"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"128510caa5a5a0b6","term":"다치다","zh":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3","entryId":"73400","definition":"被撞到或被打后身上或身体的一部分出现伤口；或指使出现伤口。","pronunciation":["다치다"]}],"audio":"/audio/33a9a229d58103605bd4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n27821-1-7-2","ko":"어제 축구하다가 축구공에 맞았어.","zh":"昨天踢足球的时候被足球砸到了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日。","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"축구하다가","meaning":"踢足球","explanation":"축구：足球；-하다：进行这项活动；-다가：正在做时发生后面的事情。这里是足球运动，不是汉字词筑构（축구하다）。","readings":[{"term":"축구","audio":"/audio/c21dee4a35ad739ca03e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36700","senseId":"1","lemma":"축구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"축구하다가","audio":"/audio/d7048f6b72f6b3030be3.mp3"}},{"text":"축구공에","meaning":"足球","explanation":"축구공：足球；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"축구공","audio":"/audio/73e76a4fd71d7fec835b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27821","senseId":"1","lemma":"축구공","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"축구공에","audio":"/audio/d9fe2af229a55510c1ea.mp3"}},{"text":"맞았어.","meaning":"打中，被打中","explanation":"맞다：打中，被打中；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66233","senseId":"3","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞았어","audio":"/audio/a922613301fe2563b957.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","z